title: "AI Machinery Atlas"
abstract: "A human-directed, AI-assisted 3D learning platform tracing AI machinery from atoms and transistors through chip design, fabrication, packaging, HBM, processing architectures, infrastructure, software, and model intelligence. Includes 210 connected lessons, formal equations, numerical labs, cited history, the CRG computation-to-realization bridge, and The Ascent companion film."
